                <mxCell id="zg-anUIbeXGqU5yxkRrn-4" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;font&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;User&#39;s Flowchart&lt;/b&gt; begins at the &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;User Dashboard&lt;/b&gt;, allowing users to manage account settings, view past scan history, and track overall progress&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Users can initiate an &lt;b&gt;AI Analysis&lt;/b&gt; by selecting either a &lt;b&gt;Body Scan&lt;/b&gt; or &lt;b&gt;Facial Scan&lt;/b&gt;, uploading a skin photo, and verifying image quality before data preprocessing and CNN AI model processing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.Body scans prompt additional symptom-related AI questions, with both scan paths saving the output to records and displaying the final analysis results&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;After AI processing, facial scans trigger &lt;b&gt;Product Recommendations&lt;/b&gt; connected to the &lt;b&gt;Products Page&lt;/b&gt;, where users can view details, rate/review, or report reviews&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;All user activity flows lead back to a centralized &lt;b&gt;Logout&lt;/b&gt; step to safely terminate the session&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="210" width="1130" x="-470" y="1460" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
